    amazonUrl: "https://amzn.to/readysealcedar",
    rating: 4.6,
    reviewCount: 13800,
    pros: [
      "Foolproof application — no laps, no streaks, no wet-line to chase on cedar",
      "Penetrating oil soaks into soft cedar instead of forming a film that peels",
      "Natural Cedar tone enhances the wood's existing reddish-brown warmth",
      "No back-brushing, no primer, and no overlap marks even on a hot day",
      "Reaches true color in 14 days as the oil cures and tones deepen",
      "Reapplication is wipe-and-go — no sanding or stripping required",
    ],
    cons: [
      "Long initial cure means the color you see on day one isn't the final color",
      "Oil base means longer dry times and mineral-spirit cleanup",
